Credit
------
cube-editor follows the ISO customization workflow of Cubic (Custom Ubuntu ISO
Creator) by PJ Singh: analyze a source ISO and its boot metadata, extract the
compressed live filesystem, edit a project root, regenerate squashfs and
filesystem metadata, and export a bootable ISO with checksums. cube-editor is an
independent implementation and contains no Cubic code or artwork.

A Cubic AppImage extraction may be kept locally under upstream/ as a reference;
upstream/extraction.json records its SHA-256 and extraction offset. The
extraction is neither part of this repository nor of the package, and it keeps
Cubic's own licenses: GPL-3.0-or-later for its code and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for its
icons.

No endorsement by the Cubic author is implied.
